  "evidence_status": "partial",
  "evidence_gap": "The retrieved evidence does not establish: GluCEST MTRasym values for akinetic-rigid predominant PD (PDAR) patients and the direct PDRT-versus-PDAR and PDAR-versus-HC glutamate comparisons."
